Trimmed real data (ruling T1), edited where noted. Package names and font
names only: no people, email addresses or personal sites.

snapshot/ is the part of a "fontsource" collector snapshot this miner reads,
from the Fontsource registry (registry/data/ of
https://github.com/fontsource/fontsource at commit
43cfc04f7f53ef63cc5781c018c4058d8908f485, 2026-09-23):

- replacements.json: 5 of its 16 entries, unchanged;
- families-google.jsonl and families-fontsource.jsonl: 13 of the 2,168
  families, each family.json cut to "family" and "status" (the test writes
  them as the snapshot's families/<group>.jsonl.gz);
- api-missing.json: 1 of the 3 rows of https://api.fontsource.org/v1/fonts
  (2026-09-25) that the registry lacks, cut to "family", "id" and "type";
- registry.json: as the collector wrote it.

http/org-fontsource.json and http/org-fontsource-variable.json: 18 of the
2,126 and 7 of the 570 packages of
https://registry.npmjs.org/-/org/fontsource/package and
https://registry.npmjs.org/-/org/fontsource-variable/package (2026-09-26),
unchanged otherwise. npm public registry data.

http/metadata-*.json: the metadata.json of five retired @fontsource packages,
as https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@fontsource/<id>/metadata.json served them on
2026-09-26, cut to "fontId", "fontName", "type", "category", "version" and
"lastModified". The x-jsd-version headers in http/index.json are the real
ones. The packages declare the MIT License.

